  "notes": [
    "Game axes: X = Blender +X, Y = Blender +Z, Z = Blender -Y; pose bones use YZX Euler = three.js XYZ.",
    "Head pivot at the skull base (back of the neck, chin height), not the head centre; neck at the collar.",
    "Lids are rigid shells about their bone world X axis (a radius per vertex): blink +1.22 closes (the hinge 1.8 cm below the eye centre line: her tall opening), the happy squint is about [0.24, -0.24], lidD -0.1 neutral, -0.24 happy. Their pivots sit behind the eyes (a 13 cm opening needs an 11+ cm hinge for 1.22 rad), not at the eyeball centres.",
    "The mouth parting was cut in the model (round 2); the lower copies are jaw-side, the corners shared (sealed). A closed cavity pocket on the parting, a tongue on its floor (jaw).",
    "Weights quantized to an exact 255 sum; <= 4 influences. Ears: head (root) -> ear -> earTip (the hanging lobe below the fold).",
    "C: the dress and its hem follow the torso with the skirt partly on the thighs toward the hem (front / side / back 30 / 16 / 22%); the satchel follows hips 55% / spine 45%; its band the torso, the bag at its ends.",
    "The sleeves follow the upper arms (the root on the chest, the cuff 40% forearm); the ears: head (the root rings in the skull) -> ear_ -> earTip_ over the top half.",
    "The lash rolls (<Fox>_lash_L/R) are lidU_* (the flicks half head past their first 30%); the lids are painted per side from the skin under them.",
    "The tail: tail1 at its root on the rump (the root rings share the hips), tail2-4 along the centreline, tail4 near the cream tip."
  ]
